  <h1>Property Management</h1>

  <p>Our property management division at Midgett &amp; Fite actively manages rental property in the Wilson County area. Clients from Virginia, Illinois, Florida, Michigan, California, and even here locally know they can trust us to serve their best interests.</p>

  <p>The current market is still hopping. With almost 100 people per day moving into the Nashville area, rental rates are high and availability is scarce. We are actively looking for new properties to manage. NOW is a great time to invest in rental property.</p>

  <p>If you own rental property, NOW is the time to lease. Whether we are in a slow real estate market, where leasing your property can provide the necessary income to allow the market time to recover, or a hot real estate market, where rental rates are rising, we can help. If your property needs a tenant, call Midgett &amp; Fite's Management Services division. We can take the hassle out of finding and keeping tenants, and we have the experience, know-how, and integrity to serve our owners of investment property well.</p>

  <p>Midgett &amp; Fite takes the risk out of property management. We tailor our service to eliminate the conflicts of interest you may experience at other firms. Whether you are waiting to sell or are a long-term real estate investor, our management services can help you profit from your real estate holdings. We keep abreast of the local rental markets and offer competitive rates.</p>

  <p>Managing property requires analytical skills, knowledge, experience, and organization. At Midgett &amp; Fite, we are experienced with the full spectrum of residential and commercial property. From retail, office, industrial, apartment, or specialty properties (including mini-storage), we have the resources to serve you.</p>

  <p>Contact us today to discuss your property management needs. You will be glad you did!</p>

